sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Spanner Node A (Leader)
    participant Spanner Replica B
    participant TrueTime API

    Client->>Spanner Node A (Leader): Begin Transaction T1 (Write X=1)
    Spanner Node A (Leader)->>Spanner Node A (Leader): Acquire Locks
    Spanner Node A (Leader)->>TrueTime API: TT.now()
    TrueTime API-->>Spanner Node A (Leader): [earliest=100, latest=105] (epsilon=5ms)
    
    Note over Spanner Node A (Leader): Set Commit Timestamp<br/>s = latest = 105
    
    Spanner Node A (Leader)->>Spanner Replica B: Paxos Propose (s=105, X=1)
    Spanner Replica B-->>Spanner Node A (Leader): Paxos Accept
    
    Note over Spanner Node A (Leader): Commit Wait Phase<br/>Wait until TT.now().earliest > s (105)
    
    loop Wait Loop
        Spanner Node A (Leader)->>TrueTime API: TT.now()
        TrueTime API-->>Spanner Node A (Leader): [earliest=104, latest=109]
        Note over Spanner Node A (Leader): 104 is NOT > 105. Keep waiting.
    end

    loop Wait Loop
        Spanner Node A (Leader)->>TrueTime API: TT.now()
        TrueTime API-->>Spanner Node A (Leader): [earliest=106, latest=111]
        Note over Spanner Node A (Leader): 106 IS > 105. Done waiting.
    end
    
    Spanner Node A (Leader)->>Spanner Node A (Leader): Apply Commit & Release Locks
    Spanner Node A (Leader)-->>Client: Commit Successful (T1)

    Note over Client, Spanner Node A (Leader): Any new transaction T2 starting now<br/>will get TT.now().earliest >= 106 > 105.<br/>Strict global ordering guaranteed!